# CIS Benchmark PDFs (proprietary — do not commit)
*.pdf

# Apotrope outputs
*.html
*.json
# brand/ is the palette source of truth — track ALL of its JSON, not just one
# file, so a future brand token (e.g. brand/palette.json) can't silently fall
# back into the *.json ignore above.
!brand/*.json
# tools/fixtures/ is the tracked input the published sample reports are built
# from — without it docs/report.html and docs/exec-report.html have no
# reproducible source, which is how they drifted to a stale version once already.
!tools/fixtures/*.json
# tests/sample_machine.json is the reconstructed sample machine the guard in
# tests/test_sample_reports.py runs the real checks against.
!tests/sample_machine.json
# docs/ is the published marketing site (GitHub Pages) — commit all of its HTML
!docs/index.html
!docs/report.html
!docs/**/*.html
apotrope_report_*

# Design review scaffolding
gen_sample_report.py
sample_report.html
.gstack/

# Local agent planning scratch (never publish — docs/ is the live site)
.superpowers/
